chat-nojev
==========

This repository is a derivative work. It takes the Jev 聊天助手 (Jev Chat
Assistant) conversation copilot and replaces its separate judgment model
(TypeSafe Jev) with a single call to an ordinary LLM: the same model that
drafts the candidate replies also answers the judgment questions, picks the
best candidate and scores the others. The question set, the option keys and
their descriptions, and the 0-9 tension criteria are carried over unchanged
from upstream; only the producer of those values differs. Because one model now
both writes and rates the candidates, the `confidence` and `probabilities`
values it returns are the model's own self-report and are not calibrated the
way the upstream judgment model's were.

Two things beyond the producer differ. The three choice questions are answered
with a short phrase in the language of the conversation instead of one of the
fixed English keys, because a general model does not need a closed label set
the way a classifier does; the keys and descriptions still frame the questions,
but `app/overlay.py`'s table translating those keys into fixed Chinese display
text (`_CHOICES`) has been removed and the panel shows the model's own wording.
And the settings page has one model section instead of two, the judgment
provider having no counterpart here.

Everything else in `windows/` is the upstream Windows application.

